# DSM - Empire of Kircheis
job-name-pretorian-knight = Pretorian Knight
job-description-pretorian-knight = You are an elite guardsman who protects the Empire's high nobility and the governor in person. Obey the governor and defend him at the cost of your own life. Nothing else matters.

job-name-regent-empire = Imperial Governor
job-description-regent-empire = You are the hand of the Kaiser, appointed personally by him to rule the sector. Coordinate all Imperial forces and ensure the survival of Imperial dominion at any cost. Defend your holdings and conduct diplomacy.
